# Data / Artifacts
# =========================
# Only ignore data files in data-pipeline directory
# Don't ignore important config files like Grafana dashboards
data-pipeline/data/processed/*
data-pipeline/data/raw/*
# Nested data directory produced when bootstrap_data.py is run from data-pipeline/
# as the working directory instead of the repo root.
data-pipeline/data-pipeline/

